EMAIL: ${clientInfo.email || 'N/A'}
--------------------------------
*MISSION PARAMETERS*
MISSION: ${selectedProgram.title}
PARTICIPANTS: ${pax}
DATE: ${formattedDate}
DURATION: ${results.days} Day(s)
