*INVESTMENT BREAKDOWN*
Base Cost: ${formatKES(results.baseTotal)}
Logistics & Ops: ${formatKES(results.venueCost + results.transportCost + results.accommodationCost + results.opsFee)}
Add-ons: ${formatKES(results.addonsTotal)}
