--------------------------------
*TOTAL INVESTMENT: ${formatKES(results.subtotal)}*
*DEPOSIT (50%): ${formatKES(results.deposit)}*
--------------------------------
_Forging Character Since 2023_`;

    window.open(`https://wa.me/254710974670?text=${encodeURIComponent(message)}`, '_blank');
